        "alt": "ISMC on Spanish TV"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Gianluca Parolin of the Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations was interviewed with Karim Hauser on Television Española in April following Casa Árabe's 10th anniversary conference, at which Dr Parolin presented in the session, 'Constitutions Undergoing Mutation: Between Legality and Legitimacy'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This live interview was for the wide audience of RTVE 24H channel, which is Spain's main news channel. It is widely broadcast, but mostly watched in Spain, and Latin America."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Watch the interview.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "http://www.rtve.es/m/alacarta/videos/la-tarde-en-24-horas/tarde-24-horas-entrevista-24-04-17/3992688/?media=tve",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The full programme  is also available.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "http://en.casaarabe.es/event/a-decade-of-transformations-in-the-arab-world",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Gianluca's paper \"Constitutions Against Revolutions\" can be found on his academia.edu page.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://aku.academia.edu/GianlucaParolin",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
